2
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,800
堂々巡りのファンタジー
A proud, wandering fantasy,

3
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:47,300
アンソロジー 混ざる有象無象
an ungrounded melody mixing fact and fiction.

4
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:49,200
本能のままに行動不能に
Acting on pure instinct, unable to move,

5
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,600
高まる衝動 (ooh-ooh)
with surging impulses, ooh-ooh.

6
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,000
もう、どうなってもいいや
Oh, come what may!

7
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:00,600
当たり前のことが知りたいだけ
I just want to know what's natural,

8
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:03,400
星に願う本当の気持ち
my true feeling whispered to the stars.

9
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:06,600
苦し紛れの言い訳は いらない、意味ない
Painful, tangled excuses are unnecessary, meaningless.

10
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:09,100
君はどう思う？ (oh)
What do you think? (Oh)

11
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:13,200
行き場を失ったみたいだ
It's like losing where I belong,

12
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,900
心は棘の類で (ふー)
my heart is full of thorns. (Ooh)

13
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:17,300
おんなじことばかり繰り返して
Repeating the same old trivial things,

14
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,400
鳥籠の中で踊る (踊る)
dancing inside a birdcage. (Dancing)

15
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
ふ和っと浮かんで取り繕うまで
Floating up softly until I'm snatched away,

16
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:25,500
描いて泣き叫んで消えないように
drawing, crying out, so it won't vanish—

17
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:28,000
魔法みたいな都合いいもの
like magic, a convenient thing.

18
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,400
主人公なら起承転結
If I'm the protagonist, it's introduction, development, twist, and conclusion.

19
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:33,200
最後はどうなってもhappy ending
In the end, even if it's a happy ending,

20
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:36,100
それなら好きにさせてよ
then let me do as I please!

21
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:38,200
もう、どうなってもいいや
Oh, come what may!

22
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:44,200
真っ逆様に落ちていってた
Falling in completely the opposite direction,

23
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:47,000
無重力midnight逃避行
zero-gravity midnight evasion flight.

24
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,000
秘密の裏から交わして囁 (囁 oh, woah)
Crossing whispers from behind secrets (whispers, oh, woah),

25
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,000
一切合切持って言って
taking everything together,

26
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,300
余すことなく人生讃歌
a human life elegy without a thing to spare.

27
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:58,300
混ざり合う星に想い馳せて (ooh, yeah)
Sending thoughts to the blending stars (ooh, yeah),

28
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:02,100
月が綺麗だなんて
saying "The moon is beautiful,"

29
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:04,100
この世はすべてワンダー 愛を叫ぶ
as if this world is all a wonder, crying out for love.

30
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,300
曖昧な窓に揺れてる君の瞳の
Focusing right onto the depths

31
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:19,400
奥へとピント合わせてフォーカス (aw)
of your eyes swaying in the hazy window (ooh).

32
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,300
誰の触れたこともない 真実のその雨に濡れた体
Drenched in the truth's rain,

33
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:25,500
ざわつくひらめく簡単じゃないから
which nobody has ever touched—

34
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,700
もっと、もっと、もっと、もっと盲目に
it's not so simple, it flutters and stirs.

35
00:05:01,988 --> 00:05:02,838
どの道悩みは尽きないし
No matter which path, troubles never end,

36
00:05:02,838 --> 00:05:03,338
いっそ望んでいる
so I might as well just wish for it.

37
00:05:03,338 --> 00:05:04,338
嫌な予感がダダ溢れ
Bad omens overflow,

38
00:05:04,338 --> 00:05:06,138
初めからそこントコ引き寄せて
pulling me in from the very start.

39
00:05:07,138 --> 00:05:09,438
月の涙がぽたこのよは
As if the tears of the moon,

40
00:05:09,488 --> 00:05:11,488
まるでストレンジャー
this world is practically a stranger,

41
00:05:11,488 --> 00:05:15,438
愛を言いわせば
and I missed the chance to say goodbye.

42
00:05:15,438 --> 00:05:17,088
気付けば隙間に落ちていった
Before I knew it, I fell right in,

43
00:05:17,088 --> 00:05:19,388
真夜中涙引きこもを
midnight tears pulling me under.

44
00:05:19,388 --> 00:05:22,088
秘密の中が交わってとりこ
Entwined in secret mysteries,

45
00:05:22,088 --> 00:05:23,388
一切合切持って行って
carrying every single thing,

46
00:05:23,388 --> 00:05:26,688
もうすることない人生を
to a completely different life.

47
00:05:26,688 --> 00:05:30,488
混ざり合う星に思い馳せて
Letting my thoughts wander to the stars we crossed.

48
00:05:30,488 --> 00:05:31,888
月が綺麗なんて
Even if the moon is lovely,

49
00:05:31,888 --> 00:05:34,388
この夜は全て割んだ
this world broke it all down.

50
00:05:34,388 --> 00:05:36,988
愛をしらば
I want to say goodbye.

51
00:05:45,038 --> 00:05:46,188
ろくでもないのファンタジー
Fantasies spinning in my head,

52
00:05:46,188 --> 00:05:48,288
うすら白い謎の作造
spinning in a chaotic dance of stars.

53
00:05:48,288 --> 00:05:49,788
自分のままにほどくように
Tearing away at my own whim,

54
00:05:49,788 --> 00:05:52,288
包み込む衝動
yielding to a sudden impulse.

55
00:05:52,288 --> 00:05:54,488
もうどうだっていいや
Whatever, it doesn't even matter.

56
00:06:35,988 --> 00:06:37,688
つまらないデイザもう散々ね!
Another boring day, nothing to show for it!

57
00:06:37,688 --> 00:06:39,688
奇跡願っているだけの人生
Living a life just wishing for miracles.

58
00:06:39,688 --> 00:06:42,288
Watch me do-do-do-do-do!

59
00:06:42,288 --> 00:06:44,288
呪術秘中トリック無しのマジック
Spellcraft secret trick, magic without a trick.

60
00:06:44,288 --> 00:06:46,188
I wanna be free! だってまだふりだし
I wanna be free! But I'm still just faking.

61
00:06:46,188 --> 00:06:47,188
(The party ain't started)

62
