Was somehow unbearably hateful.

310
00:28:06,152 --> 00:28:10,582
部屋の隅で膝を抱えて震えていていた
I'd hug my knees in the corner of my room and tremble.

311
00:28:10,582 --> 00:28:12,522
太陽なんかいらないから
I don't need the sunshine,

312
00:28:12,522 --> 00:28:15,122
明けなまいでいて
Can dawn please stay away?

313
00:28:17,552 --> 00:28:19,782
その手を伸ばして 誰かに届くように
Reach out your hand so it reaches someone.

314
00:28:19,782 --> 00:28:24,022
僕だって君と同じ 特別なんかじゃないから
I'm just like you, nothing special at all.

315
00:28:24,022 --> 00:28:29,212
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ stellar stellar
That's right, I'll sing through the night, stellar stellar,

316
